    "title": "2025 HS Football Preview: Indian River Braves - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Head coach: Brandon Carr 2024 record: 8-4 (Lost to Green Run in the Region Semifinals) Key returning players: Cameron Brooks (Senior Cornerback), Lord Malik Heru (Freshman Quarterback), Jayson Preston (Senior Wide Receiver) Coach’s quote: “The kids are out here running around. When you hear that noise, you know you’re back… Last year we learned a lot of things as a program and where we plan on heading… We have a lot coming back,” 2024 Schedule:\n8/29 vs Granby\n9/12 at Great Bridge\n9/20 at Oscar Smith\n9/26 vs Grassfield\n10/3 at Western Branch\n10/10 vs. Nansemond River\n10/17 vs Deep Creek\n10/24 at Lakeland\n10/31 vs. Kings Fork\n11/7 at Hickory For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WAVY.com.",
